      steps:['Reconstruct the run sequence, handoffs, context, and tool calls.','Compare the run with the intended success measure and stopping condition.','Locate the first consequential divergence rather than only the final symptom.','Record a bounded hypothesis and the next evaluation case.'],
      output:'A trace-based diagnosis with evidence and a next evaluation case.',
      fallback:'Supplied transcript, tool-call log, or evaluation summary.',
